MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New shared daysUntilBirthday()/isBirthdayToday() helpers in
constants.js, and a Cake icon in ui/icons.js.

Trainer side (AdminPanel ClientCard): a client whose birthday is
within 7 days gets a subtle gold "už Xd." pill; on the birthday
itself the card gets an animated gold glow, a bouncing cake badge
on the avatar, and the pill reads "Šiandien!" — all visible without
opening the client.

Client side (ClientView): on their birthday, a festive gradient
banner greets the client by name with a confetti burst, shown above
the day's content when viewing today.
